  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> kg is oscillating with simple harmonic motion (SHM). The distance between the two maximum displacement positions of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m. The kinetic energy of the object when it is at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span> m from the equilibrium position is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\"></span> J. What is the angular frequency of the oscillations?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{20}\"></span> rad s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span> rad s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> rad s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> rad s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
